WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.367
Could you tell where in the world a street is?

00:00:05.833 --> 00:00:11.900
OpenGuessr is a geography game for friends. Share a link, and they join with just a name.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.467
Everyone gets the same street and one minute to drop a pin where they think it is.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.200
When everyone has guessed, the answer appears. The closer the pin, the more points you score.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:34.567
Scores add up over five rounds.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:42.700
Every day, Gemini suggests fifty streets, and Street View confirms each one is real.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:48.100
The server scores every guess, and if the host leaves, the game carries on.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:54.133
Start a game and send the link to a friend, at openguessr.junaid.guru.
